      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Erreshoto natarreshoki Nehemia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa pee elikini Sanbalat o Tobia le Geshem ilo Marabui o kulikae mang'ati lang nchere atesheta nanu ina esuntai nemeekure etii olong'eng'e, hoo naa ore ebaiki ina kata eton eitu apik nkikeneta e kishomi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naairriwaki Sanbalat o Geshem olkilikuai ejo, “Wou manototo tenebo te nkang nabo e nkisiajata e Ono.” Kake keyieu apa ninche naaitaas entorrono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Airriwaka nanu ninche ilkiliku ajoki, “Aasita esiaai kitok nemaidim aeu. Kainyoo pee eitashe esiaai eji pee alotu enitii?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naairriwaki ninche nanu ilkiliku katitin ong'uan aaiko nji, nawaliki ninche aiko nji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake teina oitoi neirriu Sanbalat olkilikuai lenye te nkata e imiet, nereu olaisiaayiani lenye eeta empalai nabolo te nkaina enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tiatua ina palai neigero, ajo, “Etolimuoki tiatua iloshon, netejo sii Geshem neijia, nchere ore iyie o Lyahudi nintobiritata pee iseriser ina pee ishetitata esuntai, naa ijo pee iyaku olaiguanani lenye te risioroto eina limunoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itegelua sii iloibonok pee eibalie aalimu mbaa naaipirta Yerusalem, ‘Etii olaiguanani Yuda.’ Ore naa taata kelikini olaiguanani te risioroto e kulo rorei. Ore naa taata wou matoning'oto.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nairriwaki nanu olkilikuai ajoki, “A-a, ore nena baa nijoito netaasate, amu iyie oipirua ninche too ndamunot inono.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu keyieu apa pooki neiture iyiook, edamu aajo, “Keidim nkaik enye aatalepori neitiak esiaai, nemeitokini aas” kake ore iyie na Ai ntagolo iyie nkaik aainei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa pee alo enkaji e Shemaia olayioni le Delaia, olayioni le Mehatabel, apa oikenoyioki, nejo ninye, “Manototo iyiook tenebo tiatua enkaji e Nkai, tiatua ewueji sinyati, nikinken nkikeneta e nkaji e Nkai; amu aikipuonu ninche aar iyie tua, kewarie kipuonu ninche aar iyie tua.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake atiaaka nanu ninye, “Kaisik ailanyisho toltung'ani laaijo nanu? Ijo iyie kaitajeu enkishui ai tenalo aisudori tiatua enkaji e Nkai. Maas nanu ina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayiolou nanu aitisip, nadol ajo eitu eirriu Enkai ninche, kake eibalunye ninye enaibon pee aagilunore nanu, enkaraki naigero Tobia o Sanbalat ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tenkaraki ena bae apa eigeroki ninye pee aitukureti mataasa eng'oki tena oitoi, naatumoki ninche aaishoo enkarna torrono ejo pee aaitongu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tadamu Tobia o Sanbalat, na Ai ai te risioroto e kuna baa naataasa ninche, o enkoiboni sii naji No-adia o lelo kulikae oibonok laayieu naaitukuret.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkidipata e siaai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eidipe apa ina suntai te nkolong e tikitam o imiet o lapa oji le Israel Elul, too nkolong'i onom oare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ening ilmang'ati lang pooki ina, neirut iloshon pooki oomanita iyiook, neibung oloputukunyi kitok amu etumusutuo aajo etaasaki ena siaai te retoto e Nkai ang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake sii apa te nena olong'i, eirriwaitie ilkituaak le Yuda mpala aairriwaki Tobia, neirriwaki sii ninye Tobia ninche mpala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore apa iltung'ana kumok te Yuda neinosakinote olmumai o ninye, amu olaputani apa ninye le Shekania olayioni le Ara: naa olayioni lenye Yehohanan apa oyama entito e Meshulam, olayioni le Berekia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eimakita sii apa nkiaasin sidain te dukuya nanu, nepuo aaliki ninye irorei latejo. Naairriwaki Tobia mpala ejo pee aaiture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
